Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:05.61,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This year... This summer, where shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.61,0:00:08.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I want to hit a summer festival with Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.73,0:00:10.36,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,The fireworks show the next town over?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:14.29,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I do wanna see fireworks,\Nbut the show'll probably be crowded,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.29,0:00:17.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,so maybe we should go to the local \Nsummer festival that's on the same day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.87,0:00:19.62,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Does that mean wearing a yukata?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:21.66,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun in a yukata?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.66,0:00:24.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I wanna see that, \Nbut I don't want anyone else to!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:26.26,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,No, I meant you, Suzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:27.88,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wait, inviting Tani-kun comes first!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:30.27,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Term exams come before that, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:48.24,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,115)\fnArial}YOU AND I ARE POLAR OPPOSITES
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.14,0:02:05.98,Default,Gomapon,0,0,0,,All right, what we covered today \Nwill be on the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:09.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Every person has a sixth sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:13.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The light of a certain star destroys\N the minds of young children.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.38,0:02:16.49,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Aside from death, it is the fourth end!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:18.25,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,End-of-term exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.25,0:02:21.46,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The only one who remembers \Ntheir existence now is me, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.46,0:02:23.25,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,The text demons still live.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.25,0:02:27.34,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Say, did you know that "bibimbap" is actually \Npronounced more like "pibimpap"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:29.00,Default,text; right,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\fnImpact\c&H6CFFFF&\3c&H6A0097&\4c&HFEFEFE&\frz11.12\pos(510.858,42.571)}Bibimbap
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.75,0:02:29.00,Default,text; left,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\shad0\an8\fnImpact\c&HE0B8F7&\3c&H7A006F&\4c&HFEFEFE&\frz11.12\pos(538.858,203.143)}Pibimpap
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:29.00,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Don't run from reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:30.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey, did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:32.18,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Don't drag Tani-kun into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:34.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Taki-kun, how have you said it up to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:35.89,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Bibimbap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.18,0:02:37.14,Basic Sign,text; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)\fs20\bord2\frz346.8\c&HFE7F56&\pos(474.286,140.285)}Heh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:37.71,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.71,0:02:39.14,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "See?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.39,0:02:47.40,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,1)\fnImpact\c&HE0B8F7&\3c&H7A006F&\4c&HFFFFFF&\frz355.8\pos(357.715,137.429)}Pap
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:43.51,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,"Pap" means "rice," so apparently \N"pibimpap" is closer to the real pronunciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.27,0:02:47.40,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\fnImpact\c&HE0B8F7&\3c&H7A006F&\4c&HFFFFFF&\frz11.12\pos(135.429,170.571)}Pibimpap
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.51,0:02:44.54,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:47.40,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,We get it. Now please face facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.40,0:02:49.88,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Wait, what? But exams aren't {\i1}now{\i0}, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:50.77,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,We'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.77,0:02:54.28,Basic Sign,text; right,0,0,0,,{\fs20\bord2\frz322.5\pos(464,110)\c&H8BFFF0&\3c&HC8641E&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.77,0:02:54.28,Basic Sign,text; left,0,0,0,,{\frz23.32\fs20\bord2\c&H7EFFF2&\3c&HAF77D3&\pos(97.714,70)}Ho! Ho!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.77,0:02:51.50,Default - Top,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.50,0:02:51.92,Default - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,Ho!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.92,0:02:52.34,Default - Top,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.34,0:02:52.78,Default - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,Ho!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.78,0:02:53.26,Default - Top,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.26,0:02:53.66,Default - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,Ho!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.66,0:02:54.08,Default - Top,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.08,0:02:54.68,Default - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,Ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:54.28,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The ones who really shouldn't \Nshrug the exams off definitely are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.68,0:02:57.66,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Don't ask to copy my notes \Nright before exams again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:02:58.23,Default,Watanabe; Yamada,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.23,0:02:59.53,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Don't "What?!" me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:01.85,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If you're gonna copy them, do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.85,0:03:04.21,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's it! Today, we're having a study session!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:05.41,Default - Top,Watanabe; simultaneous,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:05.41,Default,Yamada; simultaneous,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.73,0:03:07.40,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, where's Taira?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:10.58,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I think he said something about \Ntraining at his part-time job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.58,0:03:11.30,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:13.97,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey, Tani! You in on this study session?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:14.80,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.22,0:03:16.16,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:17.91,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:23.41,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's not worried at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.41,0:03:26.72,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,More like Tani-kun doesn't see \Nany merit in studying with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:28.56,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No, you've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:31.46,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,He has to work in the library after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.46,0:03:32.82,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh, that's what he meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:37.32,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,1)\an8\fs24\pos(279.429,132.857)\c&H754D57&\3c&HEAEAEA&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.75,0:03:37.32,Italics,Satou; internal,0,0,0,,How were we supposed to know that? \NHe's way too short on words.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:39.90,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Hey, hang on. I just realized \Nsomething awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:41.33,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh! You, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:43.83,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs18\b1\shad3\an8\c&HFDFFCF&\3c&HAD730C&\4c&HAD730C&}Fully Equipped Air Conditioning\N\N{\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs16\c&H51A864&\3c&H09E3F1&}(Read: The Library)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:43.24,Default,Watanabe; Yamada,0,0,0,,The library!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.19,0:03:47.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,All right, start by copying my notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:49.17,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Suzuki, your notebooks are super flashy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.83,0:03:49.97,Default,text; upside down,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fax-.2\fs16\b1\shad0\frz161.3\c&H675B77&\3c&HD5C8EF&\pos(239.429,219.715)}World History
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.43,0:03:53.84,Default,text; upside down,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fax-.2\fs16\b1\shad0\c&H675B77&\3c&HD5C8EF&\frz182.5\pos(328.572,286.572)}World History
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.17,0:03:50.97,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like you do much studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:53.84,Default,text; upside down; small,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\frz145.6\3c&H666257&\c&HF7F5EE&\frx10\fry0\move(257.142,222,61.142,83.714,1,860)}High School\N {\fs14\b1}World History
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.97,0:03:53.37,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,As long as the contents are solid, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:58.47,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Crap, did we have a lecture on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.47,0:04:00.09,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I can't remember, even with the notes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:02.85,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You must've been asleep. You gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.85,0:04:05.83,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Well, you know, if things get bad, \NI'll just open the eighth gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:07.48,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(390,1)\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\bord1\b1\fs16\an8\frz24.24\c&H7DF0F8&\3c&H0F36B5&\pos(311.429,39.714)}Eight Inner Gates
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.83,0:04:07.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That makes this grave business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:10.50,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:11.97,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I'm all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.97,0:04:14.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,All you did was copy my notes. Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.23,0:04:19.91,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,If I keep studying like this, an average \Nscore of sixty won't be just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.66,0:04:21.49,Basic Sign,text. sfx,0,0,0,,{\fad(470,1)\an8\fs28\bord0\c&HC4734E&\pos(282.857,62.571)}Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:24.33,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I don't understand the homework. \NWhat's the answer to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:26.42,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Give it a {\i1}little{\i0} thought for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.42,0:04:27.38,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Meanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.51,0:04:30.26,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Tani, tell me the answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:31.47,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.47,0:04:32.53,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey, stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.59,0:04:36.67,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,And so, X equals 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:37.76,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:39.84,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Oh, I see now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:40.51,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:43.92,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Okay, Tani! Why don't you come with us \Nand we'll all go to TokyoU?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:45.59,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You're jumping way too far ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:50.14,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Then where do we stand now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.14,0:04:51.66,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You're putting me in a tough spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:55.07,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,You saying we have so much potential \Nfor growth that you can't calculate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.07,0:04:56.53,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Why are you smiling like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:04:57.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.20,0:05:02.21,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's just that seeing the person I love \Nand my friends getting closer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:04.26,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,makes me pretty... happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:06.29,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Like, I get all fidgety.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:09.29,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Hm, I think I understand a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:13.44,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,We started out in separate groups, \Nbut now the barriers are vanishing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:14.77,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.54,0:05:17.37,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I have a feeling I'll get into TokyoU.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.37,0:05:18.50,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:20.80,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,No, I think it'll be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:22.36,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Hey, Tani-kun, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:24.38,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Do you think I can make friends with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:26.04,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can, Sato!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.04,0:05:28.24,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,After all, you and Tani-kun are kind of alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:28.96,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:31.47,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Okay, time to go home! Home time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.47,0:05:34.90,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Thanks to Tani-kun, I comprehend \Neverything in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:36.07,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:39.03,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,We were talking about how \NI'm gonna aim for TokyoU.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.03,0:05:40.82,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're jumping way too far ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:44.32,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Suzuki, that's the exact same quip\N Tani-kun used!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:45.82,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Are your brains synced or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:47.99,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? That would be shameless of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.99,0:05:49.02,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:50.66,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:52.58,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yamada, don't you get it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:55.76,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Hey, she's running away. \NThat's a run of embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.11,0:05:57.10,Default - Top,Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,Honestly! I mean, really! Honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.46,0:06:01.12,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey, Tani, what time do you get off work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:04.35,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You sound like a crappy customer \Nasking when his shift is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.47,0:06:07.15,Default,Suzuki; Yamada; Watanabe,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.15,0:06:08.50,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,We're done! All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.50,0:06:11.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I feel so light and free!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.13,0:06:13.19,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Tani-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.19,0:06:16.23,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Sorry for bothering you in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.65,0:06:21.86,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's fine. People don't usually come in \Nafter school, so this was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:23.82,Italics,Satou,0,0,0,,That was fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:26.62,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey, let's grab something \Nto eat before we go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.62,0:06:28.00,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What're you in the mood for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.01,0:06:33.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Bibimbap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.22,0:06:33.33,Default - Top,Tani,0,0,0,,Pibimpap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:35.90,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:37.21,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:37.97,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,"Bap"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.99,0:06:41.51,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, you said "pap" \Nlike you're supposed to!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.51,0:06:44.51,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, you're the one \Nwho told me that was correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.51,0:06:47.01,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.43,0:06:50.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,"Bibimbap" is easier to say, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:50.14,Default,text; right,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnImpact\c&HE0B6F9&\3c&H7A0070&\4c&HFEFEFE&\pos(466.858,67.143)\frz354.5}Pibimpap
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.28,0:06:50.14,Default,text; right,0,0,0,,{\an5\shad0\fs30\fnArial\c&H69FFFC&\3c&H542695&\4c&HFEFEFE&\frz354.5\b1\pos(464,78.571)}X
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:50.14,Default,text; left,0,0,0,,{\shad0\an8\fnImpact\c&H69FFFE&\3c&H690097&\4c&HFEFEFE&\pos(190.287,66)\frz7.484}Bibimbap
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:52.68,Default,Suzuki; Yamada; Watanabe,0,0,0,,Go! Bibimbap! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:54.00,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:57.88,Default - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,I wanna eat some bibimbap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:08.42,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Suzuki can be like that sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:10.16,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Tani-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:11.66,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.72,0:07:15.96,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.96,0:07:18.03,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Are you two whispering about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.03,0:07:19.76,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Where do you get that confidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:22.90,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey! We're gonna leave you behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:25.01,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Are you up for bibimbap-ing or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.01,0:07:27.93,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I am, I am! I'm so up for bimbap-ing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:39.94,Default,text; upper left,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs16\pos(115.429,53.428)\frz16.43\c&H8FFFFD&\4c&H0995EF&\3c&H0995EF&}Bibim-don
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:39.94,Default,text; upper left; small,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\fs8\shad0\b1\pos(82,137.429)\c&H6C6F81&\3c&HE1E3FE&\frz14.79}Meal ticket\NBibim style
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.77,0:07:39.94,Default,text; right,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs18\shad0\c&HBD2EAD&\3c&HD3F5FD&\b1\pos(533.143,74)}Yup. This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:36.67,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I wish we could've gotten the stone pot kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.67,0:07:37.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:38.81,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Don't beg for luxuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:39.94,Default,text; above Tani,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs18\shad0\c&HA79D19&\3c&HD3F5FD&\b1\pos(311.429,74)}Either kind works...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:43.19,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\fnArial\shad0\bord0\b1\fs20\an1\pos(132.857,124.286)\c&H363738&}*Suzuki
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:43.19,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Sometimes, I get a little excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:44.85,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Like when...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.66,0:07:48.61,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,a convenience store opens near my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:50.07,Default,text; store sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial Black\shad0\fs18\c&H8AECEF&\3c&HE82799&}Popuri\N{\c&HE690EA&}GRAND OPENING SALE\N{\c&H5931DC&\3c&HFFFFFF&}First 3 days only
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.83,0:07:50.07,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This is today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:52.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm making a quick trip to the store!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:53.45,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(310,1)\fnArial\fs12\b1\shad0\an4\c&H353640&\3c&HE7EEF3&}I'm in the mood for ice cream\N after dinner this time of year\N{\c&H0142D7&}-S
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.67,0:07:55.45,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Oh, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.76,0:07:57.71,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Will you buy some toilet paper for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.71,0:08:00.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? That's cheaper at the supermarket.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:03.18,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Well, we only have a third of a roll left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:04.72,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.72,0:08:08.50,Default,Suzuki's brother,0,0,0,,Wait, you're going out like that? \NSo much for your pride as a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:09.72,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You need an exorcist?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:12.97,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(680,1)\an8\fnArial\fs16\bord1\shad0\b1\frz336.4\pos(506.286,171.142)\c&H7785A2&\3c&HF3FBF8&}Cigarettes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:11.56,Default,Suzuki's brother,0,0,0,,Grab some Luckys for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.56,0:08:12.97,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm not buying those!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:18.58,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I mean, he did have a point. If you \Nasked if I'd go see Tani-kun like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:19.98,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,that'd be a hard no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.98,0:08:21.98,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0\fs30\fnArial Black\fay-.25\pos(315.429,199.143)\c&HA7FCF5&\3c&HA1BBCA&}Popuri
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:23.87,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:25.32,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.49,0:08:28.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\bord1.5\c&HAAFFCC&\3c&H4D096A&\fnComic Sans MS\b1\shad0\frz9.179\pos(341.714,133.429)}We had the\N same thought
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.41,0:08:29.34,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,For real? What kind of coincidence is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:30.96,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Did you bring the flier and coupons?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:32.36,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You bet I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:34.50,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey, those gym shorts\Nare from middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:36.28,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You can't wear those out of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:40.06,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What about your fancy \Npretend-loungewear-for-going-out track pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:41.53,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You should quit while you're ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:42.33,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.26,0:08:49.23,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey! Taira's working here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.23,0:08:51.22,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Don't show up all excited on our first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.22,0:08:52.26,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You know I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:54.63,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Say, Taira, you don't live\Naround here, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:57.63,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Somewhere near school\N is easier on weekdays, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.63,0:09:00.02,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Plus, I'd see everyone from\Nmiddle school near my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.02,0:09:02.77,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh? What's wrong with having\Nyour friends come see you at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.77,0:09:07.88,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,As you may inconvenience other customers,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:10.47,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,could I ask you to hurry up\N with your shopping and leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.47,0:09:12.69,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And suddenly he's got his work face on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.03,0:09:23.54,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\an6\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs30\shad0\bord3\c&H772543&\3c&HE9EDB6&\t(1400,5110,\fs22)}Ummm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:15.06,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:19.66,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,having a guy my own age working the register \Nmakes it embarrassing to buy toilet paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:21.44,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You've got more to be embarrassed about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:23.54,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I could not care less about your embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:25.07,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.07,0:09:27.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'll come to print tickets and pick up\Nstuff shipped from flea markets!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:29.60,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Don't increase my workload!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:37.10,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Gapacho's recommendation is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.10,0:09:38.81,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Not bad, Gapacho.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:43.88,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Did it rain today?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:47.42,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Maybe for a second this evening? \NIt stopped right away, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:48.57,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah? I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.71,0:09:53.32,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You get this nice smell after it rains.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.33,0:09:58.21,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Sorry. I dunno what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.21,0:10:01.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Um, it's like plants and the earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.13,0:10:04.42,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Sorry. Please just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:10.94,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,A Cub motorcycle shifting gears?\N Is it the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:11.47,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:15.05,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,They're coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:16.22,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Make a break for it! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:20.12,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.97,0:10:22.76,Default,Suzuki; Yamada,0,0,0,,Nabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:24.23,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? What're you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.61,0:10:26.78,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I was out on my bike and took a detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.78,0:10:29.59,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,You get a nice wind on this road here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.59,0:10:31.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The one most likely to get \Nnabbed by the cops is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.55,0:10:36.95,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I thought, "Ugh. There's a delinquent \Ncouple hanging out here. This is the pits."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.95,0:10:38.97,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I'm glad it was just you two, \NSuzuki and Yamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:41.37,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,My friend saw me and thought, \N"This is the pits."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.37,0:10:44.56,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Man, Suzuki, it takes guts \Nto go out like that, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:46.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? This is my neighborhood,\Nso it's fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.70,0:10:48.63,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Middle school gym shorts are a bad sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:51.81,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I wonder what Tani-kun \Nwould think if he saw this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:54.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? Not happening! \NI'd never let him see me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:56.57,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,It's not {\i1}that{\i0} different from your usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.57,0:10:57.76,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It most certainly is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.05,0:11:00.08,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But I've got nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.08,0:11:03.72,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun would never go out to the\Nconvenience store at this time of night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:13.38,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Huh? Suzuki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:18.59,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,And... Yamada-kun and Watanabe-san, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.59,0:11:19.60,Default,Watanabe; Yamada,0,0,0,,Too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:20.03,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,1)\fnArial\b1\fs14\shad0\bord1\an7\c&HE7E278&\3c&H717238&}You noticed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.79,0:11:26.50,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Tani! Why are you wandering \Naround at this time of night?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.50,0:11:28.09,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,You must be a hoodlum! A hoodlum!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.09,0:11:30.29,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Don't close your eyes to your own faults.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:30.28,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\b1\fs18\shad0\bord1\fad(960,1)\pos(253,15)\c&HBDCB49&}Heading home from cram school...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.13,0:11:33.30,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Why did Suzuki-san disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:35.22,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Well... don't let it bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.22,0:11:36.89,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Just go and finish your shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.89,0:11:39.18,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Suzuki was never here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:40.08,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:47.04,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,You must have {\i1}something{\i0} to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:48.06,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,1)\shad0\fnArial\fs14\b1\an7\pos(37.428,98)\c&H3A383D&\3c&HF9F9F9&}Not getting teased leads \Nto its own kind of anxiety
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.06,0:11:50.22,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Okay! Run while you have the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:52.57,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,And make sure you explain yourself later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.57,0:11:53.81,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Thank you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.26,0:11:56.07,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Hey! Gimme my helmet back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.88,0:11:59.43,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.43,0:12:01.48,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I want to be myself with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.48,0:12:05.33,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,but that doesn't mean I can\N show you every little thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:08.38,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,If I did and it disillusioned you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.38,0:12:10.58,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I don't want that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.27,0:12:18.44,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Okay! Now that I've run this far, \Nlike Achilles and the tortoise...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:19.34,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:22.96,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,A-Achilles...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.91,0:12:26.35,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Why are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:30.52,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,B-Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.53,0:12:36.10,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,But none of that bothers me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.94,0:12:40.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Even if it doesn't seem like it's \Na big deal from your perspective,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.70,0:12:43.37,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,it's a vibes problem for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.75,0:12:45.00,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Vibes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.77,0:12:51.75,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Even though you don't care with Yamada-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:52.63,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:58.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Well, I mean, he's just Yamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.97,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I've known him since middle school, \Nso this is kind of small potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.97,0:13:03.86,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What about Taira-kun and Watanabe-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.86,0:13:07.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? Nabe and I have been together \Nsince our first year of high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.50,0:13:09.39,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,and Taira is... Well, he's Taira.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:09.39,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\shad0\fs14\b1\pos(173.714,92.857)\c&H704630&\3c&HFAF1E2&}Dismissed
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.35,0:13:11.17,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.31,0:13:14.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1)\fnArial\b1\shad0\bord3\an9\pos(523.143,30)\c&H65E0F6&\3c&HA66C25&}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.15,0:13:17.92,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, you seem blatantly upset right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.15,0:13:20.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(770,230)\fnComic Sans MS\fs20\b1\shad0\bord1\an8\pos(400,15)\c&H9A83E4&\3c&H26180D&}I'm understanding more and more...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.92,0:13:20.11,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I won't hear it from \Nsomeone who blatantly ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:21.40,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, boldly spoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.99,0:13:22.90,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.33,0:13:28.41,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm jealous of how long Yamada-kun\N and the others have known you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.95,0:13:32.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:36.16,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Imagine there's some food here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:40.30,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Now, let's say we have a slapped-together\N dish on a random plate
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:43.99,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,and a nicely presented one on a cute plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.99,0:13:49.68,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Even if they both taste the same, \NTani-kun, I want to give you the nice one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.94,0:13:52.19,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I want to show myself off! \NBasically, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:57.75,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No matter how it's presented,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:14:00.69,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,if it's a dish I like, then I'm not \Nconcerned about the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:06.95,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial Black\bord3\fs36\shad0\pos(497.143,15.143)\c&H9BFFF9&\3c&H69CD09&}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.73,0:14:06.95,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wait, that's problematic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:06.95,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(560,1)\fnArial Black\bord0\shad0\c&H9BFFF9&\3c&H69CD09&\pos(92,173.428)}Hang on...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.95,0:14:07.95,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:10.68,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,When I've got a pretty dish on a pretty plate,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:15.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,hearing stuff like "I like how this looks" or\N "this plating is nice" get me pumped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:16.46,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Pumped up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.93,0:14:18.96,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You mean the vibes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.19,0:14:22.09,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, the vibes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.29,0:14:26.37,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.37,0:14:27.96,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Let me ride on the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:29.10,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.10,0:14:30.82,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,But I might not be very good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.82,0:14:32.60,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's fine! Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.61,0:14:39.75,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's so nice and cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.71,0:14:43.77,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:49.62,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You know how summer nights have this \Nexquisite kind of... mood? Atmosphere?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.13,0:14:53.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Isn't it kind of thrilling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:55.76,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:58.15,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Also, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:01.82,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,this smell you get after the rain. \NI love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.18,0:15:07.08,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:12.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I love it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:26.22,Default,police,0,0,0,,Hey, Suzuki's little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.22,0:15:27.97,Default,police,0,0,0,,Don't play around out here at night! Go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.97,0:15:29.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Will do!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.44,0:15:32.26,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Why do the police know her on sight?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.95,0:15:34.04,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(850,1)\shad0\fnArial\fs10\b1\pos(529.142,163.143)\frz3.228\c&HB87A19&\3c&HB5FFFD&}Let's ride vehicles\N correctly and safely, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:39.04,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I can't wait for our summer festival date!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:42.05,Default,text; banner,0,0,0,,{\fad(1002,1)\fnArial\fs14\shad0\an8\frz19.57\c&H313639&\3c&HC0FEFA&\b1\frx16\fry356\pos(164.571,72.286)}Everyone safely escaped remedial lessons
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:42.05,Default,text; left,0,0,0,,{\an4\fad(1002,1)\fnArial\shad0\an8\frz19.57\c&HA457EF&\3c&HF7F3FF&\b1\pos(97.143,168.857)}Yay
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:42.05,Default,text; center,0,0,0,,{\fad(1002,1)\fnArial\an8\c&HF9E4AE&\3c&HBE7D37&\b1\frz355.4\pos(334.858,66)\4c&HBE7D37&}Safe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:42.05,Default,text; right,0,0,0,,{\an6\fad(1002,1)\fnArial\shad1\an8\c&HC1FEF9&\3c&H923DD3&\b1\frz342\pos(606.572,151.428)\4c&H923DD3&}Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.33,0:15:41.65,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,You sure are cheerful \Nnow that exams are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:44.54,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,And you decided to go \Nto the little festival after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:46.89,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah! If we went to fireworks show...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.89,0:15:50.01,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We'd have to fight for a spot and there's\Na big wait. Then once it's over,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:52.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,you have an unmoving line back\Nto the station. Thinking of all that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.98,0:15:53.81,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Hard facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.10,0:15:56.79,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If I wore a yukata, do you think \NI'd be trying too hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.79,0:15:59.31,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Huh? Why would you think that?\NWearing one's the way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.31,0:16:01.61,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Since there's no guarantee\Nyou'll be dating next year!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.61,0:16:02.32,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:04.74,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,How could you say that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:06.96,Default,Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,Huh?! Huh?! Huh?! Huh?! Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:08.13,Default - Top,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I'm just saying that it's best \Nto keep these things in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.96,0:16:10.75,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,You mean she shouldn't get complacent \Nor hold back in their relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:11.43,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.43,0:16:12.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:16.62,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Just don't get all giddy like a girl \Nin one of those sickeningly sweet couples.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:17.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Never gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:20.33,Default,text; top,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs18\b1\shad0\an8\pos(432.571,22)\c&H30342F&\3c&HB7BEA1&}Koneko-machi Bulletin Board
