Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:37.48,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,What should I do? Do I look weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:40.73,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Should I have gotten\N my hair done at the salon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:44.61,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,How does everyone fit everything into these\Ntiny drawstring bags? Are they geniuses?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:47.11,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Are foam sandals heretical?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:50.27,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I'm sweating so much, my makeup \Nmight already be melting off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.86,0:16:54.12,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs14\b1\frz16.85\c&H8A53F0&\3c&HF6F2F9&\move(201.231,69.692,239.385,113.384)\t(\fs10)}Nervous\NSweating
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.27,0:16:53.23,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so nervous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:16:58.81,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.05,0:17:01.24,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.35,0:17:05.77,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.77,0:17:08.75,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Um... do I look weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:09.64,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.70,0:17:11.68,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:13.68,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnTimes NEw Roman\b1\an8\c&H772CEB&\3c&HFEFEFE&}BEAUTIFUL
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.74,0:17:17.60,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Before this moment, \NI've barely cleared the "cute" bar,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:20.64,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,but have I ever been called "beautiful"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:21.44,Default,text. top bubble,0,0,0,,{\fad(640,1)\fnArial\fs10\shad0\pos(285.538,34.461)\b1\c&HC4217D&\3c&HF1FBF9&}Suzuki, that's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:21.44,Default,text; bottom bubble,0,0,0,,{\fad(640,1)\fnArial\fs10\shad0\b1\c&HBF3AE1&\3c&HF1FBF9&\pos(358.769,153.23)}Ha ha, you're cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:21.44,Default,text; box,0,0,0,,{\fad(640,1)\fnArial\fs12\shad0\b1\c&HC4A72B&\3c&HACFFFF&\pos(339.692,219.692)}*Being teased
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.43,0:17:21.44,Default,text; right side of bubble,0,0,0,,{\fad(390,1)\fnArial\fs14\b1\shad0\an3\pos(233.231,198.616)\c&H792AF0&\3c&HF8F4F9&}This kind of thing's\N happened, though
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.56,0:17:21.44,Default,text; right bubble,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnArial\fs8\b1\shad0\pos(75.692,282.924)\c&HF3AC54&\3c&HFBFAF8&}Beautifully\Ndone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.56,0:17:21.44,Default,text; left bubble,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnArial\fs8\b1\shad0\c&HA96DF2&\3c&HFBFAF8&\pos(43.692,228.155)}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.70,0:17:24.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,W-Welp, shall we go crazy at the festival?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:26.94,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,There's no need to go crazy, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:32.39,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,They've got all your\N festival sounds and smells!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.39,0:17:33.20,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.67,0:17:36.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,How about we take a quick look \Naround and decide what to buy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:38.83,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If you want anything, speak up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.08,0:17:41.58,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:44.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.80,0:17:46.00,Default,passerby,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:48.81,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.19,0:17:52.97,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,There are so many people that \Nwe'll have to be careful, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:17:58.41,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.80,0:18:08.73,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:11.74,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's sort of... like we're a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:15.49,Default,text; right,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\shad0\frz333.8\pos(464.615,86.615)\c&HD093F8&\3c&H620057&}HAPPY
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:15.49,Default,text; right,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\shad0\frz333.8\c&HD093F8&\3c&H620057&\pos(522.461,158.615)}HAPPY
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.78,0:18:15.49,Default,text; left,0,0,0,,{\fad(390,1)\an8\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\pos(147.692,30)\c&HACC013&\3c&HF6FAF2&}"Like a couple"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.81,0:18:18.99,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,This is bad! I'm totally \Ngonna end up all giddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.27,0:18:21.76,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I see him every day at school,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.76,0:18:25.25,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,but that's exactly what makes \Nthis situation so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:25.25,Default,text; left,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,1)\fnArial\b1\fs14\shad0\pos(161.231,202.308)\c&H9E0092&\3c&HD7BDE8&}Only strangers around
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:25.25,Default,text; right,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,1)\fnArial\b1\fs14\shad0\c&HC05E47&\3c&HE5D2A6&\pos(508.923,114.308)}Just the two of us out together
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:25.25,Default,text; bottom,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,1)\fnArial\b1\fs14\shad0\c&H475871&\3c&HA4EFEF&\pos(324.308,270.616)}Put extra effort into this outfit
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:25.25,Default,text; arrow,0,0,0,,{\pos(562.462,268.154)\fnArial\fs18\b1\shad0\c&H6F69F3&\3c&HEBF0F8&\frz353.8}Important
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:27.00,Default,text; right,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fay.27\b1\shad0\pos(57.23,100.154)\c&H4D7383&\3c&HF7F9FC&}Okonomiyaki
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:27.00,Default,text; left,0,0,0,,{\pos(534.154,243.538)\fay.3\fnArial Black\shad0\c&H0EF5F8&\3c&H09448C&}Yakisoba
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.99,0:18:27.00,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Granted...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:28.46,Default - Top,Tani; background,0,0,0,,Want to split it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:29.88,Default - Top,Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,Heck yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.51,0:18:30.26,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,It's best not to get too carried away, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.26,0:18:32.32,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This is so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.32,0:18:33.26,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,That said...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.62,0:18:35.76,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I can't help myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.76,0:18:38.01,Default,text; top right,0,0,0,,{\fad(890,1)\fnImpact\shad0\fs16\an8\frz339.3\pos(525.538,118)\3c&HF6F6F6&\c&H9800B2&}Topped with every flavor of syrup
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:38.01,Default,text. left; top,0,0,0,,{\fad(890,1)\fnArial Black\fs16\shad0\pos(68.307,52.77)\frz7.649\c&H3568F3&\3c&HFFFDFE&}Shaved Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.76,0:18:38.01,Default,text; left,0,0,0,,{\fad(890,1)\fnArial\b1\fs10\shad0\c&HF3333C&\3c&HFFFDFE&\frz10.99\frx344\fry12\pos(104.615,278.616)}Use as much syrup\N{\c&H1801F0&}as you want
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:41.02,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs14\shad0\b1\c&H9571F0&\3c&HCBF97F&\pos(341.143,263.714)\frz2.788}Koneko-machi Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.76,0:18:36.90,Default,Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:38.01,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,At a time like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.26,0:18:41.02,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,it's totally impossible {\i0}not{\i1} to be giddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.80,0:18:45.90,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:47.62,Default,text; top to bottom,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,460)\fnArial\b1\shad0\an8\c&H9869EE&\3c&HFDFBFF&\pos(236.308,23.23)}Super Ball
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:47.62,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,460)\fnArial\fs14\shad0\b1\pos(208,119.23)\3c&HEFFFFE&\c&H68A2B3&}Get this many, keep this many
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:47.62,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,460)\fnArial\fs14\shad0\b1\3c&HEFFFFE&\c&HC6A2F8&\pos(265.231,167.846)}1-10 balls: 1 ball
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:47.62,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,460)\fnArial\fs14\shad0\b1\3c&HEFFFFE&\c&H8A44E9&\pos(265.231,215.846)}11-20 balls: 2 balls
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:47.62,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,460)\fnArial\fs14\shad0\b1\3c&HEFFFFE&\c&H4F5E62&\pos(265.231,260.846)}21 or more: 3 balls
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.65,0:18:50.15,Default,text; center; by Suzuki,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,1)\an9\fs14\b1\fnArial\shad0\pos(260.307,44.769)\frz10.94\c&H2B2D2D&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Wordless\N pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.73,0:18:50.15,Default,text; lower right,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,1)\pos(500.923,227.538)\fnArial\b1\fs22\shad0\frz1.983\c&H8305E4&\3c&HF9F9F9&}Two balls {\c&H7DF4FA&\3c&H8017E4&}acquired!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:54.83,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to give me one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.83,0:18:57.26,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yes. Actually, I'd give you both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.26,0:18:58.72,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No, you can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:03.04,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Should you need anything to wipe your hands,\N please don't hesitate to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:04.54,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You're so prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:06.61,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I ran all kinds of simulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.91,0:19:07.04,Default,text; top to bottom,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,1)\shad0\an4\fnArial\fs14\pos(204.462,98.154)\frz7.076\b1\c&H5F37CC&\3c&HE2FFFE&}List of Handy Stuff to Have\N{\c&H375450&}-Tissues\N-Wet Towelettes\N-Handkerchief/Towel\N-Electric fan/Folding fan\N-Bandages\N-Etc.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:09.84,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wait, would not saying that have\Nmade me seem more smart and chic?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.11,0:19:12.29,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.30,0:19:19.76,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.59,0:19:25.06,Default,girl,0,0,0,,Taku-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.06,0:19:26.48,Default,boy,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:32.82,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,The way they're flirting is utterly shameless!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:34.33,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.33,0:19:38.32,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,When your giddy meter maxes out, \Nis that what you turn into?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:40.67,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,But the scary thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.67,0:19:43.83,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,there's a part of me that kind of \Nunderstands how they feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.83,0:19:46.21,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,When my boyfriend wasn't around,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.21,0:19:49.09,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I was weirdly confident \NI wouldn't get so giddy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.09,0:19:51.59,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,that I'd lose sight of my surroundings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.09,0:19:54.86,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,And yet, what was I like today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.93,0:20:02.18,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do? All of a sudden, \NI'm starting to feel super embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.52,0:20:05.35,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.35,0:20:08.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Do you maybe need to get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.02,0:20:10.84,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, do you mind a little walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.84,0:20:11.60,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:19.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow! This is the first time I've come this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.07,0:20:25.12,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,We keep climbing higher and higher. \NI wonder where he's taking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.07,0:20:28.15,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Don't tell me! A nightscape?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:30.35,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.26,0:20:35.55,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,There's a lot of people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.55,0:20:36.38,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:39.13,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.62,0:20:43.77,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Kinda iffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.63,0:20:48.94,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do? If I don't know what he's \Nthinking, it makes it harder to react.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:52.19,Default,child,0,0,0,,Hey! Aren't the fireworks starting yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.19,0:20:54.03,Default,mother,0,0,0,,It's almost time. Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.03,0:20:54.77,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.67,0:21:00.66,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:03.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The fireworks from the show we didn't go to!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.02,0:21:04.74,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You can see them from here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.74,0:21:05.99,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,They're far away, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.99,0:21:08.41,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's fine! Totally fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:14.00,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.70,0:21:19.46,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I wonder if I can capture them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.46,0:21:21.18,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,They're far, so I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:23.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.43,0:21:26.96,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I guess I'll just burn them into my eyeballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.69,0:21:37.11,Default,Tani; Suzuki,0,0,0,,That was clo—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:44.89,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.89,0:21:47.14,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I thought we were gonna kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.69,0:21:50.71,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Wait. That'd be fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.56,0:21:52.56,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,If we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.69,0:21:55.47,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Actually, I totally want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.03,0:21:56.71,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.71,0:21:57.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:22:00.28,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Next time, let's get even closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.28,0:22:01.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Next time? Even closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:03.09,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,To what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.47,0:22:06.35,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,The fireworks show. \NThey'll have it next year too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.66,0:22:07.53,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.10,0:22:15.07,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Let's go! Definitely!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:20.20,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,In Tani-kun's idea of "next year,"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.20,0:22:22.34,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I'm there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.26,0:22:31.25,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Have fun at the festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.25,0:22:33.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It was a total win.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.02,0:22:34.21,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,What'd you win at?
